  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueCutsceneTrigger
  cameraFocusTarget: {fileID: 1148442785}
  cameraPanSpeed: 2
  dialogues:
  - I swear, whoever designed this place was completely <color=red><link="wave">cracked.</link></color>
  - These hallways are a total maze.
  - Tell me about it. There are, what, a <color=#00FFFF><link="wave">hundred thousand
    of us</link></color> packed in here?
  - I got lost on floor 42 yesterday for three hours.
  - Just watch your step around these tight corners.
  - 'I bumped my <color=red><link="wave">yolk</link></color> on a doorframe earlier
    and I thought I was gonna pass out. '
  - It hurts like hell.
  - Dude, protect the <color=red><link="wave">yolk!</link></color>
  - "You know that\u2019s our <color=red><link=\"shake\">critical weak spot.</link></color>"
  - Yeah, yeah, I know.
  promptToShowAfter: {fileID: 0}
